---

<BaseLayout
  title="How Much to Spend on Child Education India: A Stage-by-Stage Budget Map"
  description="How much to spend on child education India depends on stage, not one number. Real fee data, inflation rates, and income-percentage benchmarks for a budget that lasts to college."
  canonical={canonical}
  ogType="article"
  ogImage={ogImage}
